! VTP - VLAN Trunking Protocol
!
! Core switch = VTP server, downstream switches = clients.
! VLAN database propagates automatically over trunks.
!
! Server / core
vtp mode server
vtp domain CORP
vtp password VtpSecret
vtp version 2
! vtp pruning

! Downstream switches
! vtp mode client
! vtp domain CORP
! vtp password VtpSecret
! vtp version 2

! Transparent mode: forwards VTP messages but maintains its own VLANs
! vtp mode transparent

! Verify
! show vtp status
! show vtp password
